  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d7e30d00cdc7ba446830cb52f329a3b0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  instructions: 'WASD: move player

    Mouse: rotate toward cursor

    Left mouse:
    shoot


    Bai 01: Zombie chases inside 5 m and returns home outside 5 m.

    Bai
    02: Orange cylinder uses a carving NavMeshObstacle.

    Bai 03: Blue platforms
    are connected by NavMeshLink.

    Bai 04: Purple zone uses NavMeshModifierVolume
    (area 3).


    Terrain uses editable prefabs TerrainChunk_A-D. A coordinate
    deterministically selects the same prefab every time. Keep the outermost Terrain
    border equal between prefabs to preserve seams.'
